<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>Your Mock-Fund League login verification code is:</p>

<p style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 4px;"><%= @code %></p>

<p>This code expires in <%= @expires_in_minutes %> minutes.</p>

<p>If you did not attempt to log in, you can ignore this email.</p>
